<mujoco model="industrial_table">
  <!--
    Heavy industrial workbench: a 2.90 x 1.56 m top at z=0.76 on four 0.08 x 0.08 m legs. Split out
    of the `conveyor` model (it was that model's `platform` body) so the
    belt is a bare benchtop unit that can stand on ANY table -- this one, a `desk_diy`, an
    `industrial_table`. The conveyor's own feet run from z=0.76 to 0.915, so a belt placed at the same
    pos as this table (z=0) lands exactly on this top.

    To reproduce the old bundled layout, spawn this at the belt model's local [-0.13, 0.6, 0]:

      - spawn_model: {model: industrial_table, name: bench, prefix: bench_, pos: [-0.13, 0.6, 0]}
      - conveyor:    {name: conveyor, pos: [0, 0, 0]}

    The top and the legs collide: the top catches objects that fall off the belt, and the legs are
    what the bench stands on -- with them visual-only the model could not rest on a floor at all, and
    a mobile robot drove straight through the bench. The legs sit at the corners, 1.41 m out from the
    centre, so they are nowhere near an arm working at the benchtop.
  -->
  <compiler angle="radian" autolimits="true"/>

  <asset>
    <material name="industrial_table_top" rgba="0.45 0.47 0.50 1" specular="0.4" shininess="0.3"/>
    <material name="industrial_table_frame" rgba="0.60 0.60 0.62 1" specular="0.4" shininess="0.3"/>
  </asset>

  <worldbody>
    <body name="industrial_table">
      <geom name="industrial_table_top" type="box" size="1.45 0.78 0.02" pos="0 0 0.74"
            material="industrial_table_top"/>
      <geom name="industrial_table_leg_1" type="box" size="0.04 0.04 0.36" pos="1.41 0.74 0.36"
            material="industrial_table_frame"/>
      <geom name="industrial_table_leg_2" type="box" size="0.04 0.04 0.36" pos="-1.41 0.74 0.36"
            material="industrial_table_frame"/>
      <geom name="industrial_table_leg_3" type="box" size="0.04 0.04 0.36" pos="1.41 -0.74 0.36"
            material="industrial_table_frame"/>
      <geom name="industrial_table_leg_4" type="box" size="0.04 0.04 0.36" pos="-1.41 -0.74 0.36"
            material="industrial_table_frame"/>
    </body>
  </worldbody>
</mujoco>
